### Create shipping
POST http://localhost:8087/api/shipping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "15f5d60d-cda9-4152-a282-de2cd8b9075d",
  "userId": "7eecc8f3-a7eb-4753-b5bf-9eac7c7ac987",
  "address": "Jl. Merdeka No. 1, Jakarta"
}

### Get shipping by ID
GET http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb

### Get shipping by order ID
GET http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/order/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb

### Get shipping by user ID
GET http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/user/7eecc8f3-a7eb-4753-b5bf-9eac7c7ac987

### Update tracking
PATCH http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb/tracking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "JNE",
  "trackingNumber": "JNE001234567"
}

### Update status to SHIPPED
PATCH http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHIPPED"
}

### Update status to IN_TRANSIT
PATCH http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}

### Update status to DELIVERED
PATCH http://localhost:8087/api/shipping/1931a60b-bd35-4251-8a72-4f94438f0deb/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}
